        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films/Franchises: Blank Check, Air Bud, Santa Buddies, Air Buddies\n- People: Rupert Wainwright, Brian Bonsall, Karen Duffy, Miguel Ferrer, James Rebhorn, Tone Lōc, Jayne Atkinson, Michael Lerner, Buddy\n- Songs: \"I'll Wait\"\n\nFacts:\n- Blank Check is a 1994 American comedy film directed by Rupert Wainwright and starring Brian Bonsall, Karen Duffy, Miguel Ferrer, James Rebhorn, Tone Lōc, Jayne Atkinson, and Michael Lerner.\n- The song \"I'll Wait\" was featured in the 1994 Disney comedy Blank Check.\n- Air Bud is a 1997 American comedy film that sparked the Air Bud franchise centered on the real-life Golden Retriever Buddy.\n- Santa Buddies is the fourth installment of the Air Buddies spin-off series and the ninth film in the Air Bud franchise.",
